  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ、大丈夫！\r\nちゃんと終わったよーっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──それでねっ、聞いて聞いて！\r\nさっき、おばあちゃんが話しかけてくれてねっ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『さっき歌ってるのが聞こえた』って\r\n『知らない歌だったけど、楽しい気持ちになった』って",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『だからありがとう、これからも頑張って』って──！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "！\r\nそうか──！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "これって、わたしたちの気持ち、\r\nおばあちゃんに届いたんだよねっ……！？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そういうことだ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるが歌に込めた気持ちが、\r\nめぐるのことを知らない人にも、届いたってことだ……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だよね、そうだよね……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、嬉しいなー……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……あのね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし、もっとたくさんの人に、\r\nわたしのことを知ってもらいたいなって思ってた",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "見た目だけじゃなくて、歌だけじゃなくて、\r\nダンスだけじゃなくて──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "イルミネーションスターズの八宮めぐるはこんなだよーっ！\r\nって！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……でもね、それってもしかしたら──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "『デパートの屋上で歌ってた女の子』でもいいのかもって\r\n思ったの",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、それでも、\r\nおばあちゃんは今日、楽しい気持ちになれたんだもん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "楽しんでほしいなって気持ちがちゃんと届いて、\r\n『あの子を見たからだ』って思ってもらえるんだったら──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それが八宮めぐるだってわかってもらえなくても、\r\nきっと大丈夫なんだって──！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、もちろん、アイドルだから\r\nちゃんと名前も覚えてもらわなきゃなんだけど……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん、そうだな\r\n言いたいことは伝わったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるはきっと、そういうふうに思ってて大丈夫だ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるの気持ちが伝わるように、めぐるの『本当』が\r\n覚えてもらえるように、頑張ってくれればいい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこから先は俺の仕事だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのおばあさんが、まためぐるに会って──\r\nテレビでも雑誌でも映画でもいい、まためぐるを見て──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、あの時デパートの上で歌ってた女の子は、\r\n八宮めぐるっていうんだって、覚えられるようにするから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ\r\n──うん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──えへへっ、ありがとう、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300202/1003002020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003002020230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そしたら、これからも一緒に──\r\n一緒に頑張ろうね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
